== ast.RootPretokens
# Does the file start with a comment?
# Is there an empty newline before the first field comment?
# If so then put the first comment block as a Pre token for the root object.
# These are meant to be "file-level comments" for convenience.

# The rest is field comments.

# Field comment 2.
Field: Value
== ast.RootClosetokens
# Root Pre comment.

# Node comment.
