CrazyList:  [[Year   1999    Month 12   Day	30] [Hour 13 Minute 34] [{list:[]}] [] {} [ x] [[][][]{}] [{obj: {}}] [ ] [obj {v1:1 v2:2}{ v3:v3}]] # comment 1
SimpleValue: 1 # comment 2

